[engl]
{100}{}{Training Dummy}
{200}{}{You see an training dummy.}
{210}{}{You see a wooden stall with an armor strapped on it. Doesn't even compare to the Vault-Tec robot simulations.}
{220}{}{Knocked out.}
{230}{}{Knocked out but still on the stand.}
{240}{}{Broken.}
{250}{}{Beyond repair, this dummy needs to be removed up.}
{260}{}{Needs replacement.}
{270}{}{Needs replacement.}
{1000}{}{Preddialogue settings}
{1010}{}{ }
{2000}{}{A combat armor strapped on two poles.}
{2010}{}{[Check stats]}
{2020}{}{Upgrades.}
{2030}{}{Downgrades.}
{2040}{}{Repair.}
{2050}{}{[Leave]}
{3000}{}{You can add some extra protection layers to this dummy, to strenghten it's construction.
