- 2 x Fibers
- 2 x Gecko Pelt
}
{9010}{}{Upgrade In Your Face.}
{9020}{}{[Back]}
{9030}{}{[Leave]}
{10000}{}{To make the dummy more knock resistant, you will need a tools and some materials:
- 1 x Junk
- 1 x Wood
- 1 x Good Metal Parts}
{10010}{}{Upgrade Stonewall.
}
{10020}{}{[Leave]}
{10030}{}{[Back]}
{11000}{}{To protect the dummies critical parts, you will need some tools and:
- 1 x Junk
- 1 x Good Metal Parts}
{11010}{}{Upgrade Man of Steel.}
{11020}{}{[Back]}
{11030}{}{[Leave]}
{12000}{}{To protect the dummies loose parts more, you will need some tools and:
- 1 x Junk
- 2 x Fibers
- 2 x Golden Gecko Pelts}
{12010}{}{Upgrade Iron Limbs.}
{12020}{}{[Back]}
{12030}{}{[Leave]}
{13000}{}{To curse this dummy to be most distracting, you will need some tools and:
